<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Approval Pending | RKU Attendance</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #2c3e50; --accent: #3498db; --warning: #f39c12; --bg: #f4f7f6; }
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: var(--bg); margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; }
        
        .container { 
            background: white; 
            padding: 40px; 
            max-width: 450px; 
            width: 90%;
            border-radius: 15px; 
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); 
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 5px solid var(--warning);
        }

        .icon-box {
            font-size: 60px;
            color: var(--warning);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }

        h2 { color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 10px; }
        p { color: #7f8c8d; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 15px; }
        
        .user-badge {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .status-info {
            background: #fff9f0;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--warning);
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .btn-logout {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .btn-logout:hover {
            background: #34495e;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 0.7; }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="icon-box">
        <i class="fas fa-user-clock"></i>
    </div>
    
    <h2>Access Pending</h2>
    <p>We've received your registration! For security reasons, a SuperAdmin must manually verify your identity.</p>
    
    <div class="user-badge">
        <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> <%= user.email %>
    </div>

    <div class="status-info">
        <strong>Next Steps:</strong>
        <ul style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Notify your Department Head.</li>
            <li>Verification usually takes 2-4 hours.</li>
            <li>Once approved, you will gain full dashboard access.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #bdc3c7;">If this is urgent, please contact the IT Helpdesk.</p>

    <a href="/logout" class="btn-logout"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Return to Login</a>
</div>

</body>
</html>